      "source": "Returns <a href=\"#ORDER\">1800</a>, which ensures that the <code>ApplicationEventsTestExecutionListener</code>\nis ordered after the\n<a href=\"../support/DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener</code></a> and before the\n<a href=\"../bean/override/BeanOverrideTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.bean.override\"><code>BeanOverrideTestExecutionListener</code></a> and the\n<a href=\"../support/DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回 <a href=\"#ORDER\">1800</a>，这确保了 <code>ApplicationEventsTestExecutionListener</code> 在 <a href=\"../support/DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DirtiesContextBeforeModesTestExecutionListener</code></a> 之后且在 <a href=\"../bean/override/BeanOverrideTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.bean.override\"><code>BeanOverrideTestExecutionListener</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../support/DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>DependencyInjectionTestExecutionListener</code></a> 之前执行。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a> value for this listener: 1800.",
      "translation": "此监听器的<a href=\"#getOrder()\"><code>order</code></a>值为：1800。",
      "count": 3
