      "source": "This listener manages the registration of <code>ApplicationEvents</code> for the\ncurrent thread at various points within the test execution lifecycle and makes\nthe current instance of <code>ApplicationEvents</code> available to tests via an\n<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/annotation/Autowired.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>@Autowired</code></a>\nfield in the test class.",
      "translation": "该监听器在测试执行生命周期的各个阶段管理当前线程的 <code>ApplicationEvents</code> 注册，并通过测试类中的 <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/annotation/Autowired.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>@Autowired</code></a> 字段向测试提供当前 <code>ApplicationEvents</code> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the test class is not annotated or meta-annotated with\n<a href=\"RecordApplicationEvents.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.event\"><code>@RecordApplicationEvents</code></a>, this listener\neffectively does nothing.",
      "translation": "如果测试类未使用 <a href=\"RecordApplicationEvents.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context.event\"><code>@RecordApplicationEvents</code></a> 进行标注或元标注，则该监听器实际上不起作用。",
